cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "astroph2discord"
abstract: >-
  A tool that delivers new and revised arXiv astro-ph papers matching your
  keywords to a Discord channel every weekday, running for free on GitHub
  Actions. Features include keyword scoring, revision (v2, v3, ...) detection,
  de-duplication, an author watch-list, and optional Japanese translation of
  abstracts via DeepL.
authors:
  - family-names: "Yamaguchi"
    given-names: "Masayuki"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8185-9882"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23278312"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Y-Masayuki/astroph2discord"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - arXiv
  - astro-ph
  - astronomy
  - Discord
  - notification
  - GitHub Actions
